Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.32,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}An army's strength at departure is only the starting point.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.41,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}大军出发时的人数，只是这段行程的起点。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.32,0:00:09.19,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}Before battle, its supplies, troop numbers and route can all change.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.41,0:00:07.45,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}到接战以前，还要经过补给变
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.45,0:00:10.26,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}化、兵员变化和路线选择。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.19,0:00:14.41,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}We need to see when it actually arrives, how many of the original troops
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.26,0:00:15.13,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}我们要看的，是它什么时候真正到场，原来的兵还剩
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.41,0:00:19.56,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}remain, how much supply it carries, and what it actually paid along the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.13,0:00:19.79,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}多少，带着多少补给，以及途中实际付了什么钱。
